    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Nichol:Tutorial_Nichol_002:fa7d1f4f",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_Nichol",
        "key": "Tutorial_Nichol_002",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Nichol:Tutorial_Nichol_002:fa7d1f4f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Nichol:Tutorial_Nichol_002:fa7d1f4f",
        "jp_sha256": "49f4e50f1c9fe1c5d4c115ecfc49a61db2dd4b6f72a7ad9910b53f5f55f14c23",
        "official_en_sha256": "b95b0e9740351103757ba4881e6217d83ddadcf5e8f8715982628b0b7178dbdc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ニコルは軍師として、味方を強化する「陣」を使って戦います。\r\n\r\n「陣」は直接相手を攻撃する技ではありませんが、\r\n味方全体を大幅にパワーアップして、戦闘を有利に展開できます。\r\n\r\n様々な種類があるので、戦況に応じて使い分けるのが重要です。\r\n\r\nまた、ニコルは「陣」の使い勝手や効果を強化する技を\r\n覚えていくため、戦況に合わせて戦略を練ってみてください。",
        "official_en": "As a strategist, Nichol utilizes Formation skills that buff\r\nallies.\r\n\r\nFormations are not direct attacks, but instead\r\nsignificantly increase the fighting capabilities of all\r\nallies, tipping the battle in your favor.\r\n\r\nThere are multiple Formations, each with varying\r\neffects, so be sure to use the ones that best suit  the\r\nsituation.\r\n\r\nAs Nichol grows, he’ll also learn skills that enhance or\r\nmodify the effects of Formations, giving you even more\r\ntactical options.",
        "real_en": "As a strategist, Nichol fights using Formations that strengthen his allies.\r\n\r\nFormations are not direct attacks, but they can greatly strengthen the whole party and turn a battle in your favor.\r\n\r\nThere are many types, so choose the right Formation for the situation.\r\n\r\nNichol will also learn skills that make Formations easier to use or enhance their effects, so plan your strategy to suit the battle."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
